            "PX1912-Q019"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "LTF-007-C02",
          "text": {
            "en": "God’s goodness and justice are not opposed: His providence governs creation wisely while respecting the freedom of rational creatures.",
            "fr": "La bonté et la justice de Dieu ne s’opposent pas : sa Providence gouverne sagement la création tout en respectant la liberté des créatures raisonnables."
