          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "LTF-012-C02",
          "text": {
            "en": "His teaching, miracles, Passion, death and Resurrection reveal both His divine identity and His saving mission.",
            "fr": "Son enseignement, ses miracles, sa Passion, sa mort et sa Résurrection manifestent à la fois son identité divine et sa mission salvifique."
