            "PX1912-Q093",
            "PX1912-Q094"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "LTF-015-C02",
          "text": {
            "en": "The Resurrection confirms His victory over death, while the Ascension marks His glorified return to the Father.",
            "fr": "La Résurrection confirme sa victoire sur la mort, tandis que l’Ascension marque son retour glorifié auprès du Père."
          },
          "catechismRefs": [
